														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1431438">
									

<p>This is pretty well-written in terms of execution, though could use tightening in some places (the Foundation wouldn't refer to what happens to the game's players as &quot;increasingly horrific&quot;, I think). The major problem is in the concept itself, &quot;game what kills you.&quot; I think we have at least one or two SCPs that are games-what-kill-you (that I don't love either, really). Moreover, as someone in chat pointed out, the prevalence of anomalous video games in creepypasta in general leaves me pretty inured to the overall horror of the situation.</p>
<p>No vote; it's not bad, but it doesn't blow me away, either.</p>

