			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1431442">
									

<p>This is hard to give constructive feedback about. On the one hand, it's basically well-written, and I especially like the manual excerpt. You've captured the tone of those early Nintendo manuals pretty well.</p>
<p>On the other hand, this is one of the most overused tropes in creepypasta. So what we've got here is a decent take on a bad idea.</p>
<p>This is a no vote from me, but I suspect it won't do well. Try again with a different object?</p>
<hr />
<p>Edit: Apparently I'm wrong. :)</p>

